Z||000000||fastback87||11-05-2001||01:27 PM||||What is the difference between trannys that came with the different years and engine types?  I was wanting to put a manual in my 87 gt 2.8 and can get all the stuff off of an 87 se 4cyl....Will it work?  what do I need to do?||||reg||5
Z||000001||FieroPerformance||11-05-2001||04:24 PM||||Yeah, it will work... I think... I have a 5 speed from a 4 cylinder in my 85 GT. You need to use the flywheel from your v6 and the clutch, pressure plate, and t/o bearing from the 4 cylinder.<P>I don't know the details of how to do it because it was already done when I bought the car.<P>-Charlie<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsigfperformance.jpg"> ||||reg||1
